          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "kind": "open",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Runtime test validity / build parity — Requires further review: Existing .next production artifact and current source correspondence\n\nRuntime uses Nov 4 Windows-generated .next artifact; smoke passes but artifact-to-checkout exact parity was not established. Rebuilding source in a separate isolated copy would be required for any discrepancy-dependent validation; bundled native sharp is Windows-only and local image optimization remains untested."
          },
          "locations": [
